@startuml
' Shared layout, included by every diagram via a plain relative  !include layout/colors.puml
' (relative to the including .puml file, standard PlantUML). The Kroki server has no
' filesystem, so whoever sends the diagram (asciidoctor-kroki JS on the site, the Ruby gem's
' preprocessor for the PDF, the IDE plugin) inlines this content first.

hide circle
hide methods

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F7FBFF
  BorderColor     #2E6DA4
  ArrowColor      #2E6DA4
  FontColor       #1A1A1A
}
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F7FBFF
  BorderColor     #2E6DA4
}
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
@enduml
